%% Chat and notifications (Socket.IO + REST)
%% Status: current | Related: docs/product/features.md § Chat & realtime
flowchart TB
  subgraph Chat
    List[GET /api/chat conversations] --> Open[Open conversation]
    Open --> Send[POST message]
    Send --> Meter[checkAndIncrementUsage chats_per_day]
    Meter --> Store[Persist message]
    Store --> SocketEmit[Socket.IO new_message + typing]
    SocketEmit --> Client[useChatRealtime on ChatPage]
  end

  subgraph Notifications
    Event[Order / reservation / chat event] --> Prefs[notification_preferences]
    Prefs --> Log[Insert notification_log]
    Log --> SocketPush[Socket.IO notification_new]
    SocketPush --> Alerts[useNotificationAlerts toast + bell]
    Prefs --> Channels{Plan + toggles}
    Channels --> Email[email]
    Channels --> WhatsApp[whatsapp tiers]
    Channels --> Push[Web Push VAPID]
  end

  Store --> Event
